# Hair on cards, step 1 (reports/content/2026-11-npc-hair): the hero's own head close up under the three lights of
# its intent (reports/content/2026-11-hero-head/intent.md, «Место») - noon in the Khorinis market, midnight in the
# harbour street (moon and sky only: the braziers stand too far), the hearth- and candle-lit harbour house of
# perf-interior. Under each: the face from three angles of `cam face`, still clips (the eyes blink) and one still each
# (a shot takes the next frame: the wait after it keeps the next teleport out). The torch behind the hero is step
# 5's. Brows and lashes are glTF MASK cards: run it with OPENGOTHIC_HASHED_ALPHA=0 (threshold 0.5) and =1 (hashed
# alpha under TAA), and judge the two side by side as clips.
#   OPENGOTHIC_HASHED_ALPHA=0 TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1920x1080 BENCH_HOST=ryzen \
#     OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=~/.local/share/gothic-ai/content-tests/hero-head-1 scripts/bench.sh scripts/bench/hair-clips.bench <out>
# @timeout 600
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
# 1. Noon in the market: the sun high and to the side
set time 12 0
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
watch player
cam face 38 0 1
wait 10000
rec day-front
wait 4000
stop
shot day-front
wait 300
cam face 38 40 1
wait 1500
rec day-quarter
wait 4000
stop
shot day-quarter
wait 300
cam face 38 90 1
wait 1500
rec day-profile
wait 3000
stop
shot day-profile
wait 300
# 2. Midnight in the harbour street: the moon and the night sky
cam cut
set time 0 0
goto pos 5391 320 -5822
watch player
cam face 38 0 1
wait 10000
rec night-front
wait 4000
stop
shot night-front
wait 300
cam face 38 40 1
wait 1500
rec night-quarter
wait 4000
stop
shot night-quarter
wait 300
cam face 38 90 1
wait 1500
rec night-profile
wait 3000
stop
shot night-profile
wait 300
# 3. The hearth- and candle-lit harbour house of perf-interior at 22:00: warm light low and to the side
cam cut
set time 22 0
goto pos 3924 -73 -6663
watch player
cam face 38 0 1
wait 10000
rec candle-front
wait 4000
stop
shot candle-front
wait 300
cam face 38 40 1
wait 1500
rec candle-quarter
wait 4000
stop
shot candle-quarter
wait 300
cam face 38 90 1
wait 1500
rec candle-profile
wait 3000
stop
shot candle-profile
wait 300
